    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/8d3481ded0e7b84d061dc831dd3e5e1e.avif?t=1727802481\" width=600 height=175 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/5965ff4216a2a78170cc46fe10a28cf1.avif?t=1727802481\" width=616 height=175 /></span><br>Play as <strong>3 robots</strong> each with their own <strong>unique abilities</strong>. Work together to <strong>solve puzzles</strong> and escape the factory before you are scrapped! The game features <strong>30 levels</strong> across three distinctive environments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/062d47fe83a08960350392b945cde07d.poster.avif?t=1727802481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/062d47fe83a08960350392b945cde07d.webm?t=1727802481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/062d47fe83a08960350392b945cde07d.mp4?t=1727802481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/3c129df5128ead797eb933fce503b05d.avif?t=1727802481\" width=616 height=175 /></span><br>Play <strong>solo or co-op</strong> with up to <strong>3 players</strong>, local and online!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/64182d36d050b8f2f4b8ae7f3966a18e.poster.avif?t=1727802481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/64182d36d050b8f2f4b8ae7f3966a18e.webm?t=1727802481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/64182d36d050b8f2f4b8ae7f3966a18e.mp4?t=1727802481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/9c3c9e48c496b44d6ecbcea46c7bff5b.avif?t=1727802481\" width=616 height=175 /></span><br>Unlock <strong>different styles</strong> for the robots as you progress through the game!<strong> Equip</strong> hats to show off their style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/69c88ba5c4ee6ed5b60da8f254ec355a.avif?t=1727802481\" width=616 height=175 /></span><br>Race the clock in the <strong>time trial mode</strong>, facing off against your friends and players worldwide. Secure your place on the <strong>leaderboard</strong> and see the fastest times for each level. Complete achievements and find secrets for <strong>special rewards</strong>!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/5965ff4216a2a78170cc46fe10a28cf1.avif?t=1727802481\" width=616 height=175 /></span><br>Play as <strong>3 robots</strong> each with their own <strong>unique abilities</strong>. Work together to <strong>solve puzzles</strong> and escape the factory before you are scrapped! The game features <strong>30 levels</strong> across three distinctive environments.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/062d47fe83a08960350392b945cde07d.poster.avif?t=1727802481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/062d47fe83a08960350392b945cde07d.webm?t=1727802481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/062d47fe83a08960350392b945cde07d.mp4?t=1727802481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/3c129df5128ead797eb933fce503b05d.avif?t=1727802481\" width=616 height=175 /></span><br>Play <strong>solo or co-op</strong> with up to <strong>3 players</strong>, local and online!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/64182d36d050b8f2f4b8ae7f3966a18e.poster.avif?t=1727802481\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/64182d36d050b8f2f4b8ae7f3966a18e.webm?t=1727802481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/64182d36d050b8f2f4b8ae7f3966a18e.mp4?t=1727802481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/9c3c9e48c496b44d6ecbcea46c7bff5b.avif?t=1727802481\" width=616 height=175 /></span><br>Unlock <strong>different styles</strong> for the robots as you progress through the game!<strong> Equip</strong> hats to show off their style.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926710/extras/69c88ba5c4ee6ed5b60da8f254ec355a.avif?t=1727802481\" width=616 height=175 /></span><br>Race the clock in the <strong>time trial mode</strong>, facing off against your friends and players worldwide. Secure your place on the <strong>leaderboard</strong> and see the fastest times for each level. Complete achievements and find secrets for <strong>special rewards</strong>!",
    "short_description": "Steambots is a puzzle platformer where you play as three faulty robots who have to escape their factory to avoid being scrapped! Play alone or team up with your friends! Multiple levels, local and online co-op, time trials, customisation and more!",
